      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.33,
      "end_seconds": 249.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low on the left and the pregnancy test is positive"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.75,
      "end_seconds": 288.46,
      "duration_seconds": 34.71,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Having listened and examined, the most likely explanation is a pregnancy of unknown location, ectopic not excluded. I'm sending you for a pregnancy test because of late period and spotting. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Even with little pain this needs a scan within a day, and go to hospital if the the pain gets worse."
    },
